     "notes": {
      "text": "4...Nf6 hits e4, and with your pawn on c3 you can no longer defend it with Nc3. The quiet main line is 5.d3, but 5.d4 strikes at once, attacking the bishop and intending 6.e5 after 5...exd4 (the Greco Gambit). 5.b4!? (Bird's Attack) tries to trap the bishop. Later, Qb3 can add pressure on f7.",
